1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,420
 To all who continue to face the pain, fear, and loneliness of life, I echo the Savior's

2
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:11,840
 words, "Be not afraid, only believe."

3
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:17,460
 In His time and way, Jesus Christ will deliver you.

4
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:25,440
 Some miracles are immediate, some come after long waiting, and some await the resurrection.

5
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:31,240
 Today we hear, believe, and act on our great deliverers reassuring voices.

